<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; ">The
Company&#8217;s total lease expenses under ASC 842 are $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c15" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="6" unitRef="usd">0.70</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c16" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="6" unitRef="usd">0.67</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for the three months ended October 31,
2023 and 2022, respectively. The Company&#8217;s total lease expenses under ASC 842 are $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="6" unitRef="usd">1.48</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c17" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="6" unitRef="usd">1.23</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for
the six months ended October 31, 2023 and 2022, respectively. The Company&#8217;s ROU assets and lease liabilities are recognized using
an effective interest rate of range&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c283" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">4.5</ix:nonFraction>% to&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c284" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">6.25</ix:nonFraction>%, which was determined using the Company&#8217;s incremental borrowing rate.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

